WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:10.920
Letting the artist know in advance whether you'll wear glasses helps design the best possible look for the day.

2
00:00:11.256 --> 00:00:19.512
Since the lenses can obscure the eyes, eye makeup needs to be emphasized more clearly and vividly to read through glasses,

3
00:00:19.848 --> 00:00:27.720
and ultra-fine lashes that make the eyes sparkle without touching the lenses can be custom-prepared.

4
00:00:28.056 --> 00:00:38.736
The eyebrow depth or lip color can also be fine-tuned to match the frame's design and color, so everything harmonizes with the hanbok too.

5
00:00:39.072 --> 00:00:49.920
When wearing hanbok, choosing thin metal or rimless frames over anything flashy gives the most elegant, refined impression.

6
00:00:50.256 --> 00:00:54.576
If you decide to go without glasses on the day,

7
00:00:54.912 --> 00:01:05.016
take the glasses off starting that morning so the nose pad marks fade and don't show clearly on your skin.

8
00:01:05.352 --> 00:01:15.312
If poor vision without your glasses makes you squint without realizing it, you may look less approachable in photos or when greeting guests,

9
00:01:15.648 --> 00:01:23.232
so decide carefully based on whether you can actually recognize your guests' faces.
